proposal = "In services/platform/hosted/gateway/src/explorer_proxy.rs admit GET /api/v2/paxeer-x/feed/markets and in ui_proxy.rs admit /explorer/feed and its Next data route. Cover the real overview request through both gateway handlers and regenerate the route catalogue without widening unrelated routes."
