proposal = "Change apps/explorer/lib/socket/types.ts TokenTotalSupply and apps/explorer/ui/pages/Token.tsx buffered state to the producer decimal-string type; use an explicit undefined check for buffered values and add an actual string-payload socket case with zero and a value above 2^53."
